utside factor is $\\frac{4}{3}\\cdot 3=4$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "9b712a6e-6e52-5783-8e96-8c4185897b37" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "9b712a6e-6e52-5783-8e96-8c4185897b37" :question/answer-fields "16a9d0a3-e9cd-5559-afce-e8648bbcdcfe"] [:db/ensure "9b712a6e-6e52-5783-8e96-8c4185897b37" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "9b712a6e-6e52-5783-8e96-8c4185897b37"] [:db/add "303097de-de9e-5a4e-9694-a009057cbd3c" :answer/id #uuid "303097de-de9e-5a4e-9694-a009057cbd3c"] [:db/add "303097de-de9e-5a4e-9694-a009057cbd3c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "303097de-de9e-5a4e-9694-a009057cbd3c" :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "303097de-de9e-5a4e-9694-a009057cbd3c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7933756d-d4ec-54f9-a957-dd98d971866d" :answer/id #uuid "7933756d-d4ec-54f9-a957-dd98d971866d"] [:db/add "7933756d-d4ec-54f9-a957-dd98d971866d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7933756d-d4ec-54f9-a957-dd98d971866d" :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "7933756d-d4ec-54f9-a957-dd98d971866d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a7dd16fb-bc99-52d7-9e33-3166eedac853" :answer/id #uuid "a7dd16fb-bc99-52d7-9e33-3166eedac853"] [:db/add "a7dd16fb-bc99-52d7-9e33-3166eedac853" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a7dd16fb-bc99-52d7-9e33-3166eedac853" :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}\\rig