m "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "f0d24e1a-b76a-52fa-be50-ddfb085b96e6" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot 2=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "f0d24e1a-b76a-52fa-be50-ddfb085b96e6" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "f0d24e1a-b76a-52fa-be50-ddfb085b96e6" :question/answer-fields "0928067e-abf1-5601-af9a-eb0232cac731"] [:db/ensure "f0d24e1a-b76a-52fa-be50-ddfb085b96e6" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "f0d24e1a-b76a-52fa-be50-ddfb085b96e6"] [:db/add "76be5748-22da-5774-81d8-207bb26aaee4" :answer/id #uuid "76be5748-22da-5774-81d8-207bb26aaee4"] [:db/add "76be5748-22da-5774-81d8-207bb26aaee4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "76be5748-22da-5774-81d8-207bb26aaee4" :answer/value "3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "76be5748-22da-5774-81d8-207bb26aaee4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "054aa328-8f57-565a-a206-535421169ab4" :answer/id #uuid "054aa328-8f57-565a-a206-535421169ab4"] [:db/add "054aa328-8f57-565a-a206-535421169ab4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "054a