ng the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "d7cc6f44-f7b9-56ad-865b-19c03ea6f303" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "d7cc6f44-f7b9-56ad-865b-19c03ea6f303" :question/answer-fields "28d3e114-d1f1-57f2-a856-156056ae0331"] [:db/ensure "d7cc6f44-f7b9-56ad-865b-19c03ea6f303" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "d7cc6f44-f7b9-56ad-865b-19c03ea6f303"] [:db/add "76c3d541-ae48-5f20-8898-b82e96bcd9f1" :answer/id #uuid "76c3d541-ae48-5f20-8898-b82e96bcd9f1"] [:db/add "76c3d541-ae48-5f20-8898-b82e96bcd9f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "76c3d541-ae48-5f20-8898-b82e96bcd9f1" :answer/value "3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "76c3d541-ae48-5f20-8898-b82e96bcd9f1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "17a284c1-3a91-5b3a-a195-75a698973a1c" :answer/id #uuid "17a284c1-3a91-5b3a-a195-75a698973a1c"] [:db/add "17a284c1-3a91-5b3a-a195-75a698973a1c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "17a284c1-3a91-5b3a-a195-75a698973a1c" :answer/value "-3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "17a284c1-3a91-5b3a-a195-75a698973a1c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "144b05a5-35ce-58f4-8aa2-b53cb03d74c8" :answer/id #uuid "144b05a5-35ce-58f4-8aa2-b53cb03d74c8"] [:db/add "144b05a5-35ce-58f4-8aa2-b53cb03d74c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "144b05a5-35ce-58f4-8aa2-b53cb03d74c8" :answer/value "6\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "144b05a5-35ce-58f4-8aa2-b53cb03d74c8" :an