3}{\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "ef9178db-b6e7-5406-845d-17dcc05cb1b7" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}=4\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{4})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot 4=3$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "ef9178db-b6e7-5406-845d-17dcc05cb1b7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "ef9178db-b6e7-5406-845d-17dcc05cb1b7" :question/answer-fields "791b6536-9985-59fa-b96f-2454c13c5270"] [:db/ensure "ef9178db-b6e7-5406-845d-17dcc05cb1b7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "ef9178db-b6e7-5406-845d-17dcc05cb1b7"] [:db/add "bae754e5-56fa-5165-992d-7eee88b14f2f" :answer/id #uuid "bae754e5-56fa-5165-992d-7eee88b14f2f"] [:db/add "bae754e5-56fa-5165-992d-7eee88b14f2f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "bae754e5-56fa-5165-992d-7eee88b14f2f" :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "bae754e5-56fa-5165-992d-7eee88b14f2f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9056a6ad-448a-5790-90f9-14397d2335a7" :answer/id #uuid "9056a6ad-448a-5790-90f9-14397d2335a7"] [:db/add "9056a6ad-448a-5790-90f9-14397d2335a7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9056a6ad-448a-5790-90f9-14397d2335a7"