nswer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "5fa55012-786c-5c42-b08f-8ccd8d230e56" :answer-field/choices "13620ef1-e521-5058-8942-a85b7380b61d"] [:db/add "5fa55012-786c-5c42-b08f-8ccd8d230e56" :answer-field/choices "184bf7ca-9faf-5864-a12d-17d7ce2a9de1"] [:db/add "5fa55012-786c-5c42-b08f-8ccd8d230e56" :answer-field/choices "f0da924d-eeec-51b9-8b8b-9111f49f6766"] [:db/add "5fa55012-786c-5c42-b08f-8ccd8d230e56" :answer-field/choices "d064ecce-76fd-5b68-9c4c-ae08837f2cdf"] [:db/add "5fa55012-786c-5c42-b08f-8ccd8d230e56" :answer-field/choices "1c4f7e60-b53e-5871-a8cd-d619a79bd856"] [:db/add "5fa55012-786c-5c42-b08f-8ccd8d230e56" :answer-field/correct "1c4f7e60-b53e-5871-a8cd-d619a79bd856"] [:db/ensure "5fa55012-786c-5c42-b08f-8ccd8d230e56" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a4759172-33f7-52ee-b4bf-483a956b3b02" :question/id #uuid "a4759172-33f7-52ee-b4bf-483a956b3b02"] [:db/add "a4759172-33f7-52ee-b4bf-483a956b3b02" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{25 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "a4759172-33f7-52ee-b4bf-483a956b3b02" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{2 x}{5}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{2}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{25 - 4 x^{2}}=5\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{2 x}{5})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{5}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{4}{5}\\cdot \\frac{5}{2}=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{25 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "a4759172-33f7-52ee-b4bf-483a956b3b02" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "a4759172-33f7-52ee-b4bf-483a956b3b02" :question/answer-fields "5fa55012-786c-5c42-b08f-8ccd8d230e56"] [:db/ensure "a4759172-33f7-52ee-b4bf-483a956b3b02" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "a4759172-33f7-52ee-b4bf-483a956b3b02"] [:db/add "b92d90cc-a214-50e5-b54e-5caf1f7a0b02" :answer/id #uuid "b92d90cc-a214-50e5-b54e-5caf1f7a0b02"] [:db/add "b92d90cc-a214-50e5-b54e-5caf1f7a0b02" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b92d90cc-a214-50e5-b54e-5caf1f7a0b02" :answer/value "\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "b92d90cc-a214-50e5-b54e-5caf1f7a0b02" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c0061cb1-8680-52d6-9d21-78b4ec405974" :answer/id #uuid "c0061cb1-8680-52d6-9d21-78b4ec405974"] [:db/add "c0061cb1-8680-52d6-9d21-78b4ec405974" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c0061cb1-8680-52d6-9d21-78b4ec405974" :answer/value "\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{3} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "c0061cb1-8680-52d6-9d21-78b4ec405974" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e3ae4fea-f54e-5655-b37f-72e280bea302" :answer/id #uuid "e3ae4fea-f54e-5655-b37f-72e280bea302"] [:db/add "e3ae4fea-f54e-5655-b37f-72e280bea302" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e3ae4fea-f54e-5655-b37f-72e280bea302" :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "e3ae4fea-f54e-5655-b37f-72e280bea302" :answer/validate] [:db/add "50e18cac-7a33-543e-95e3-3ea2eb889e61" :answer/id #uuid "50e18cac-7a33-543e-95e3-3ea2eb889e61"] [:db/add "50e18cac-7a33-543e-95e3-3ea2eb889e61" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "50e18cac-7a33-543e-95e3-3ea2eb889e61" :answer/value "-1\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "50e18cac-7a33-543e-95e3-3ea2eb889e61" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e2f48239-3241-574d-bd74-e7019be7d99c" :answer/id #uuid "e2f48239-3241-574d-bd74-e7019be7d99c"] [:db/add "e2f48239-3241-574d