uding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{9 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "6ab1dc30-1799-5701-87df-381e5894e2ee" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "6ab1dc30-1799-5701-87df-381e5894e2ee" :question/answer-fields "8091343a-bce8-5305-8188-2e61041cbb5a"] [:db/ensure "6ab1dc30-1799-5701-87df-381e5894e2ee" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "6ab1dc30-1799-5701-87df-381e5894e2ee"] [:db/add "b4cd4c2e-f5e9-577d-9bbb-762fbfddb901" :answer/id #uuid "b4cd4c2e-f5e9-577d-9bbb-762fbfddb901"] [:db/add "b4cd4c2e-f5e9-577d-9bbb-762fbfddb901" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b4cd4c2e-f5e9-577d-9bbb-762fbfddb901" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "b4cd4c2e-f5e9-577d-9bbb-762fbfddb901" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ea3cb756-4738-595d-b6e5-05d7815ccc00" :answer/id #uuid "ea3cb756-4738-595d-b6e5-05d7815ccc00"] [:db/add "ea3cb756-4738-595d-b6e5-05d7815ccc00" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ea3cb756-4738-595d-b6e5-05d7815ccc00" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "ea3cb756-4738-595d-b6e5-05d7815ccc00" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b2726a61-7fb1-5ae3-8672-5769978ab291" :answer/id #uuid "b2726a61-7fb1-5ae3-8672-5769978ab291"] [:db/add "b2726a61-7fb1-5ae3-8672-5769978ab291" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b2726a61-7fb1-5ae3-8672-5769978ab291" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "b2726a61-7fb1-5ae3-8672-5769978ab291" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d153aaf8-c145-54ef-bc22-c8df6b4ecc43" :answer/id #uuid "d153aaf8-c145-54ef-bc22-c8df6b4ecc43"] [:db/add "d153aaf8-c145-54ef-bc22-c8df6b4ecc43" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d153aaf8-c145-54ef-bc22-c8df6b4ecc43" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "d153aaf8-c145-54ef-bc22-c8df6b4ecc43" :answer/validate] [:db/add "946d6ced-7687-56b8-8965-24ca7453c6ed" :answer/id #uuid "946d6ced-7687-56b8-8965-24ca7453c6ed"] [:db/add "946d6ced-7687-56b8-8965-24ca7453c6ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "946d6ced-7687-56b8-8965-24ca7453c6ed" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "946d6ced-7687-56b8-8965-24ca7453c6ed" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6ed717e7-eac0-5f19-899d-85290b2c76c1" :answer-field/id #uuid "6ed717e7-eac0-5f19-899d-85290b2c76c1"] [:db/add "6ed717e7-eac0-5f19-899d-85290b2c76c1" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "6ed717e7-eac0-5f19-899d-85290b2c76c1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "6ed717e7-eac0-5f19-899d-85290b2c76c1" :answer-field/choices "b4cd4c2e-f5e9-577d-9bbb-762fbfddb901"] [:db/add "6ed717e7-eac0-5f19-899d-85290b2c76c1" :answer-field/choices "ea3cb756-4738-595d-b6e5-05d7815ccc00"] [:db/add "6ed717e7-eac0-5f19-899d-85290b2c76c1" :answer-field/choices "b2726a61-7fb1-5ae3-8672-5769978ab291"] [:db/add "6ed717e7-eac0-5f19-899d-85290b2c76c1" :answer-field/choices "d153aaf8-c145-54ef-bc22-c8df6b4ecc43"] [:db/add "6ed717e7-eac0-5f19-899d-85290b2c76c1" :answer-field/choices "946d6ced-7687-56b8-8965-24ca7453c6ed"] [:db/add "6ed717e7-eac0-5f19-899d-85290b2c76c1" :answer-field/correct "b4cd4c2e-f5e9-577d-9bbb-762fbfddb901"] [:db/ensure "6ed717e7-eac0-5f19-899d-85290b2c76c1" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "bae20d5d-4436-5e8e-8143-212aaf8c29ca" :question/id #uuid "bae20d5d-4436-5e8e-8143-212aaf8c29ca"] [:db/add "bae20d5d-4436-5e8e-8143-212aaf8c29ca" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 9 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "bae20d5d-4436-5e8e-8143-212aaf8c29ca" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{3 x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{3}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - 9 x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{3 x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{2}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{1}{3}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 9 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "bae20d5d-4436-5e8e-8143-212aaf8c29ca" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "bae20d5d-4436-5e8e-8143-212aaf8c29ca" :question/answer-fields "6ed717e7-eac0-5f19-899d-85290b2c76c1"] [:db/ensure "bae20d5d-4436-5e8e-8143-212aaf8c29ca" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "bae20d5d-4436-5e8e-8143-212aaf8c29ca"] [:db/add "49b64ae9-2f05-59ec-8cd8-c6fc3fd6f7d5" :answer/id #uuid "49b64ae9-2f05-59ec-8cd8-c6fc3fd6f7d5"] [:db/add "49b64ae9-2f05-59ec-8cd8-c6fc3fd6f7d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "49b64ae9-2f05-59ec-8cd8-c6fc3fd6f7d5" :answer/value "\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{5} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "49b64ae9-2f05-59ec-8cd8-c6fc3fd6f7d5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "073c2bd5-178d-5e5e-823d-2e38e6dd56a1" :answer/id #uuid "073c2bd5-178d-5e5e-823d-2e38e6dd56a1"] [:db/add "073c2bd5-178d-5e5e-823d-2e38e6dd56a1" :answer/ty