oices "6aebfbc6-0dd0-5a4a-a307-07b5285bb523"] [:db/add "1ac6138a-4c7e-5f02-8816-1b474bd6824d" :answer-field/choices "36e3bc7e-3e6b-5063-8190-6803e2a8c0a1"] [:db/add "1ac6138a-4c7e-5f02-8816-1b474bd6824d" :answer-field/correct "073c2bd5-178d-5e5e-823d-2e38e6dd56a1"] [:db/ensure "1ac6138a-4c7e-5f02-8816-1b474bd6824d" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5a421a58-948e-5542-a6c4-c105fa219eee" :question/id #uuid "5a421a58-948e-5542-a6c4-c105fa219eee"] [:db/add "5a421a58-948e-5542-a6c4-c105fa219eee" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{25 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "5a421a58-948e-5542-a6c4-c105fa219eee" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{4 x}{5}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{4}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{25 - 16 x^{2}}=5\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{4 x}{5})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{5}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{2}{5}\\cdot \\frac{5}{4}=\\frac{1}{2}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{25 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "5a421a58-948e-5542-a6c4-c105fa219eee" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "5a421a58-948e-5542-a6c4-c105fa219eee" :question/answer-fields "1ac6138a-4c7e-5f02-8816-1b474bd6824d"] [:db/ensure "5a421a58-948e-5542-a6c4-c105fa219eee" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "5a421a58-948e-5542-a6c4-c105fa219eee"] [:db/add "722ac779-7083-5a49-83f8-aaaaa2b80e42" :answer/id #uuid "722ac779-7083-5a49-83f8-aaaaa2b80e42"] [:db/add "722ac779-7083-5a49-83f8-aaaaa2b80e42" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "722ac779-7083-5a49-83f8-aaaaa2b80e42" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "722ac779-7083-5a49-83f8-aaaaa2b80e42" :answer/validate] [:db/add "84d26cec-bf95-52a4-82c6-191bf6e0248c" :answer/id #uuid "84d26cec-bf95-52a4-82c6-191bf6e0248c"] [:db/add "84d26cec-bf95-52a4-82c6-191bf6e0248c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "84d26cec-bf95-52a4-82c6-191bf6e0248c" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{8 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "84d26cec-bf95-52a4-82c6-191bf6e0248c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cc440545-8002-5ed8-aa58-849ba3d3216c" :answer/id #uuid "cc440545-8002-5ed8-aa58-849ba3d3216c"] [:db/add "cc440545-8002-5ed8-aa58-849ba3d3216c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cc440545-8002-5ed8-aa58-849ba3d3216c" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "cc440545-8002-5ed8-aa58-849ba3d3216c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "917617eb-968c-51da-8a65-27c8dc62b077" :answer/id #uuid "917617eb-968c-51da-8a65-27c8dc62b077"] [:db/add "917617eb-968c-51da-8a65-27c8dc62b077" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "917617eb-968c-51da-8a65-27c8dc62b077" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "917617eb-968c-51da-8a65-27c8dc62b077" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7fdfdfdb-d6e8-53a1-b19f-0e2c8cb9c6d2" :answer/id #uuid "7fdfdfdb-d6e8-53a1-b19f-0e2c8cb9c6d2"] [:db/add "7fdfdfdb-d6e8-53a1-b19f-0e2c8cb9c6d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7fdfdfdb-d6e8-53a1-b19f-0e2c8cb9c6d2" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "7fdfdfdb-d6e8-53a1-b19f-0e2c8cb9c6d2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ba45e3fa-5a75-57a1-9d67-fb7109b2d239" :answer-field/id #uuid "ba45e3fa-5a75-57a1-9d67-fb7109b2d239"] [:db/add "ba45e3fa-5a75-57a1-9d67-fb7109b2d239" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "ba45e3fa-5a75-57a1-9d67-fb7109b2d239" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "ba45e3fa-5a75-57a1-9d67-fb7109b2d239" :answer-field/choices "722ac779-7083-5a49-83f8-aaaaa2b80e42"] [:db/add "ba45e3fa-5a75-57a1-9d67-fb7109b2d239" :answer-field/choices "84d26cec-bf95-52a4-82c6-191bf6e0248c"] [:db/add "ba45e3fa-5a75-57a1-9d67-fb7109b2d239" :answer-field/choices "cc440545-8002-5ed8-aa58-849ba3d3216c"] [:db/add "ba45e3fa-5a75-57a1-9d67-fb7109b2d239" :answer-field/choices "917617eb-968c-51da-8a65-27c8dc62b077"] [:db/add "ba45e3fa-5a75-57a1-9d67-fb7109b2d239" :answer-field/choices "7fdfdfdb-d6e8-53a1-b19f-0e2c8cb9c6d2"] [:db/add "ba45e3fa-5a75-57a1-9d67-fb7109b2d239" :answer-field/correct "722ac779-7083-5a49-83f8-aaaaa2b80e42"] [:db/ensure "ba45e3fa-5a75-57a1-9d67-fb7109b2d239" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e9837837-4dfe-557d-bb99-4d563c43757b" :question/id #uuid "e9837837-4dfe-557d-bb99-4d563c43757b"] [:db/add "e9837837-4dfe-557d-bb99-4d563c43757b" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{9 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "e9837837-4dfe-557d-bb99-4d563c43757b" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{4 x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{4}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{9 - 16 x^{2}}=3\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{4 x}{3})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{3}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{1}{4}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{9 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "e9837837-4dfe-557d-bb99-4d563c43757b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "e9837837-4dfe-557d-bb99-4d563c43757b" :question/answer-fields "ba45e3fa-5a75-57a1-9d67-fb7109b2d239"] [:db/ensure "e9837837-4dfe-557d-bb99-4d563c43757b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "e9837837-4dfe-557d-bb99-4d563c43757b"] [:db/add "0d74a0bc-6669-5dc1-a7aa-7c6914dc8b72" :answer/id #uuid "0d74a0bc-6669-5dc1-a7aa-7c6914dc8b72"] [:db/add "0d74a0bc-6669-5dc1-a7aa-7c6914dc8b72" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0d74a0bc-6669-5dc1-a7aa-7c6914dc8b72" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "0d74a0bc-6669-5dc1-a7aa-7c6914dc8b72" :answer/validate] [:db/add "85a9477d-631e-54f9-ad68-90931c4e5e95" :answer/id #uuid "85a9477d-631e-54f9-ad68-90931c4e5e95"] [:db/add "85a9477d-631e-54f9-ad68-90931c4e5e95" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "85a9477d-631e-54f9-ad68-90931c4e5e95" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "85a9477d-631e-54f9-ad68-90931c4e5e95" :answer/validate] [:db/add "23bf9b35-76c9-5566-a5b2-bef24abb7312" :answer/id #uuid "23bf9b35-76c9-5566-a5b2-bef24abb7312"] [:db/add "23bf9b35-76c9-5566-a5b2-bef24abb7312" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "23bf9b35-76c9-5566-a5b2-bef24abb7312" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "23bf9b35-76c9-5566-a5b2-bef24abb7312" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1db1ac4b-da39-5be2-8b5f-1f8334b730dc" :answer/id #uuid "1db1ac4b-da39-5be2-8b5f-1f8334b730dc"] [:db/add "1db1ac4b-da39-5be2-8b5f-1f8334b730dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1db1ac4b-da39-5be2-8b5f-1f8334b730dc" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "1db1ac4b-da39-5be2-8b5f-1f8334b730dc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "54fb07c6-b2cc-5105-be5b-8391129ca9d4" :answer/id #uuid "54fb07c6-b2cc-5105-be5b-8391129ca9d4"] [:db/add "54fb07c6-b2cc-5105-be5b-8391129ca9d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "54fb07c6-b2cc-5105-be5b-8391129ca9d4" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "54fb07c6-b2cc-5105-be5b-8391129ca9d4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ff5050c7-b549-5879-a4b9-e1c7ea1c08cc" :answer-field/id #uuid "ff5050c7-b549-5879-a4b9-e1c7ea1c08cc"] [:db/add "ff5050c7-b549-5879-a4b9-e1c7ea1c08cc" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "ff5050c7-b549-5879-a4b9-e1c7ea1c08cc" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "ff5050c7-b549-5879-a4b9-e1c7ea1c08cc" :answer-field/choices "0d74a0bc-6669-5dc1-a7aa-7c6914dc8b72"] [:db/add "ff5050c7-b549-5879-a4b9-e1c7ea1c08cc" :answer-field/choices "85a9477d-631e-54f9-ad68-90931c4e5e95"] [:db/add "ff5050c7-b549-5879-a4b9-e1c7ea1c08cc" :answer-field/choices "23bf9b35-76c9-5566-a5b2-bef24abb7312"] [:db/add "ff5050c7-b549-5879-a4b9-e1c7ea1c08cc" :answer-field/choices "1db1ac4b-da39-5be2-8b5f-1f8334b730dc"] [:db/add "ff5050c7-b549-5879-a4b9-e1c7ea1c08cc" :answer-field/choices "54fb07c6-b2cc-5105-be5b-8391129ca9d4"] [:db/add "ff5050c7-b549-5879-a4b9-e1c7ea1c08cc" :answer-field/correct "54fb07c6-b2cc-5105-be5b-8391129ca9d4"] [:db/ensure "ff5050c7-b549-5879-a4b9-e1c7ea1c08cc" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a1bf7056-d8a3-5bfc-b4c4-259afae4fff6" :question/id #uuid "a1bf7056-d8a3-5bfc-b4c4-259afae4fff6"] [:db/add "a1bf7056-d8a3-5bfc-b4c4-259afae4fff6" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "a1bf7056-d8a3-5bfc-b4c4-259afae4fff6" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - 16 x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(2 x)^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{1}{4}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "a1bf7056-d8a3-5bfc-b4c4-259afae4fff6" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "a1bf7056-d8a3-5bfc-b4c4-259afae4fff6" :question/answer-fields "ff5050c7-b549-5879-a4b9-e1c7ea1c08cc"] [:db/ensure "a1bf7056-d8a3-5bfc-b4c4-259afae4fff6" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "a1bf7056-d8a3-5bfc-b4c4-259afae4fff6"] [:db/add "b9663600-ee74-5d96-b0ad-3fb5c5e4f8aa" :answer/id #uuid "b9663600-ee74-5d96-b0ad-3fb5c5e4f8aa"] [:db/add "b9663600-ee74-5d96-b0ad-3fb5c5e4f8aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b9663600-ee74-5d96-b0ad-3fb5c5e4f8aa" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "b9663600-ee74-5d96-b0ad-3fb5c5e4f8aa" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c9c0a9ca-5468-5a4d-bbbc-6b0183d32c9c" :answer/id #uuid "c9c0a9ca-5468-5a4d-bbbc-6b0183d32c9c"] [:db/add "c9c0a9ca-5468-5a4d-bbbc-6b0183d32c9c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c9c0a9ca-5468-5a4d-bbbc-6b0183d32c9c" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "c9c0a9ca-5468-5a4d-bbbc-6b01