6385b4803"] [:db/add "cf293a22-6792-5aaf-9cdc-3621ff704f81" :answer-field/correct "878c1c4e-c46e-5a68-b7ba-4c64f162a149"] [:db/ensure "cf293a22-6792-5aaf-9cdc-3621ff704f81" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "dfc32bf8-6ace-5e48-bc5e-92e930371a4c" :question/id #uuid "dfc32bf8-6ace-5e48-bc5e-92e930371a4c"] [:db/add "dfc32bf8-6ace-5e48-bc5e-92e930371a4c" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{9 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "dfc32bf8-6ace-5e48-bc5e-92e930371a4c" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{2 x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{2}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{9 - 4 x^{2}}=3\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{2 x}{3})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{3}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot \\frac{3}{2}=\\frac{3}{2}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{9 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "dfc32bf8-6ace-5e48-bc5e-92e930371a4c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "dfc32bf8-6ace-5e48-bc5e-92e930371a4c" :question/answer-fields "cf293a22-6792-5aaf-9cdc-3621ff704f81"] [:db/ensure "dfc32bf8-6ace-5e48-bc5e-92e930371a4c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "dfc32bf8-6ace-5e48-bc5e-92e930371a4c"] [:db/add "68000a08-75fb-51a6-8bc1-784b7354d8e9" :answer/id #uuid "68000a08-75fb-51a6-8bc1-784b7354d8e9"] [:db/add "68000a0